.TH ORO-TOML 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:toml \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:toml'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
A compliant TOML 1.0 parser implemented in pure JavaScript.
.PP
import { parse } from 'oro:toml' const config = parse(await fs.readFile('config.toml', 'utf8'))
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBTomlLocalDate\fR
Represents a TOML local date.
.TP
