Documented method exposed by this module.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIyear\fR (number; required)
.br
\fImonth\fR (number; required)
.br
\fIday\fR (number; required)
.TP
\fBTomlLocalTime\fR
Represents a TOML local time.
.TP
